Postcode patterns (R/sysdata.rda, object `postcodes`)
----------------------------------------------------

The postal-code regular expression (`zip`) and example postal codes (`zipex`)
for each country are taken from Google's Address Data Service,
https://chromium-i18n.appspot.com/ssl-address/data, the metadata used by
libaddressinput (https://github.com/google/libaddressinput). They were
retrieved on 2026-11-14 by data-raw/postcodes.R; only these two fields are
kept, and no value is changed.

